{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Topographical Agnosia takes place in the Australian Outback, where you become lost after missing the town where you planned to refuel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now stranded, there is something very wrong with this area, it has long been deserted. As you explore, you will uncover notes and clues that will help you unlock houses in search of fuel for your vehicle or a weapon to ensure your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boring gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little to no puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dumb AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fog to be annoying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quest direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shooting but only if gun found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk slow and run slow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No saves or checkpoint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little to no jump scares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pathetic horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3341950?t=1734718411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1734718411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341950/18be49436ee6594b4630c5f79e6e53fefcdbb3ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734718411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341950/18be49436ee6594b4630c5f79e6e53fefcdbb3ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1734718411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Topographical Agnosia takes place in the Australian Outback, wher